Hmm, this won't automatically maintain aspect ratio. Let me use JavaScript to compute the scale:

```javascript
function resizeCanvas() {
    const canvas = document.getElementById('gameCanvas');
    const scaleX = window.innerWidth / 960;
    const scaleY = window.innerHeight / 640;
    const scale = Math.min(scaleX, scaleY);
    canvas.style.width = (960 * scale) + 'px';
    canvas.style.height = (640 * scale) + 'px';
}
window.addEventListener('resize', resizeCanvas);
resizeCanvas();
```

And in CSS:
```css
